<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Roadcorp to raise 45 mln rand with rights.</title>
<headline>Roadcorp to raise 45 mln rand with rights.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roadcorp Ltd said on Monday it planned to raise 44.7 million rand before expenses by way of a renounceable rights offer.</p>
<p>The shares will be offered for subscription in the ratio of 90 new shares for every 100 held at a price pf 190 cents.</p>
<p>Last day to register is May 23.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom, +27-11 482 1003</p>
</text>
